Description: 4k intro by tonic, released in 2004
 Shadow Sun is a 4k intro by tonic, winner of the 2nd #demoscene 4k
 source compo in May 2004. It renders lit spheres orbiting in additive
 blending in a 640x480 OpenGL window, with music synthesized in real time.
 .
 The intro uses SDL 1.2 through sdl12-compat (SDL 2). Press Escape to quit.
